{"text": "One day Murlock returned from hunting and found his wife ill with a fever, so confused in her mind that she did not even recognize him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was no doctor within miles and no neighbor to call, and since she could not be left alone, he had no choice but to care for her himself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For three days he nursed her alone, but on the third day she sank into unconsciousness and passed away, apparently without ever coming back to her senses. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> From what we know of a nature like his, we may venture to fill in some of the details of the picture that my grandfather drew. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When he was convinced that she was dead, Murlock had sense enough to remember that the dead must be prepared for burial. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In performing this sacred duty, he made mistakes now and then, did certain things incorrectly, and did others which he had done correctly over and over again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was surprised that he did not weep, and he felt a little ashamed of it, for surely it is unkind not to weep over the dead. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Tomorrow, he said aloud, I shall have to make the coffin and dig the grave, but things cannot be so bad as they seem.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", "e", " ", "d", "a", "y", " ", "M", "u", "r", "l", "o", "c", "k", " ", "r", "e", "t", "u", "r", "n", "e", "d", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "h", "u", "n", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "f", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "w", "i", "f", "e", " ", "i", "l", "l", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "a", " ", "f", "e", "v", "e", "r", ",", " ", "s", "o", " ", "c", "o", "n", "f", "u", "s", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "m", "i", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "s", "h", "e", " ", "d", "i", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", " ", "r", "e", "c", "o", "g", "n", "i", "z", "e", " ", "h", "i", "m", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "